ed in Kabul, Colombia?</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123244566.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/who-is-terry-cole-trumps-main-man-for-dc-police-takeover-who-worked-in-kabul-colombia/articleshow/123244566.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/who-is-terry-cole-trumps-main-man-for-dc-police-takeover-who-worked-in-kabul-colombia/articleshow/123244566.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-12T01:09:16+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123244565,imgsize-33468.cms"/></item><item><title>In unusual move, US to take cut of AI chips sold to China</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123244859.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-unusual-move-us-to-take-cut-of-ai-chips-sold-to-china/articleshow/123244859.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-unusual-move-us-to-take-cut-of-ai-chips-sold-to-china/articleshow/123244859.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-12T02:29:34+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123244863,imgsize-31112.cms"/></item><item><title>Israel steps up Gaza bombing after Bibi vow to expand offensive; airstrike kills 6 journos</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123244854.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/israel-steps-up-gaza-bombing-after-bibi-vow-to-expand-offensive-airstrike-kills-6-journos/articleshow/123244854.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-ea