orks-steel-plant-explosion-dozens-injured-several-trapped-beneath-rubble-rescue-ops-under-way/articleshow/123241265.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/clairton-coke-works-steel-plant-explosion-dozens-injured-several-trapped-beneath-rubble-rescue-ops-under-way/articleshow/123241265.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-11T23:10:50+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123241436,imgsize-1041603.cms"/></item><item><title>'I will know in minutes if we can make deal': Donald Trump on meeting with Vladimir Putin; talks on Russia-Ukraine peace deal</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123240830.cms" /&gt;Donald Trump announced he will meet with Vladimir Putin in Alaska on August 15, 2025, expressing confidence he'll quickly determine if a peace deal with Ukraine is possible. Trump aims for a ceasefire and plans to engage Putin, followed by discussions with Volodymyr Zelenskyy and other European leaders. He criticised Zelenskyy's stance on territorial concessions, suggesting potential land swaps.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/i-will-know-in-minutes-if-we-can-make-deal-donald-trump-on-meeting-with-vladimir-putin-talks-on-russia-ukraine-peace-deal/articleshow/123240830.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/i-will-know-in-minutes-if-we-can-make-deal-donald-trump-on-meeting-with-vladimir-putin-talks-on-russia-ukraine-peace-deal/articleshow/123240830.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-11T22:00:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123241245,imgsize-48774.cms"/></item><item><title>Watch: Video of 'UCLA administrator' applauding as Chinese-origin student blasts ICE, Trump</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123241244.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/watch-video-of-ucla-administrator-applauding-as-chinese-origin-student-blasts-ice-trump/articleshow/123241244.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/watch-video-of-ucla-administrator-applauding-as-chinese-origin-student-blasts-ice-trump/articleshow/123241244.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-11T22:27:44+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123241246,imgsize-19522.cms"/></item><item><title>'Liberation Day': Why is Trump taking over Washington DC? All you need to know about crackdown in deep blue state</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123240129.cms" /&gt;US President Trump has declared a federal takeover of Washington, DC, citing concerns over crime and homelessness. He termed it as “Liberation Day” and promised a crackdown, deploying federal agents and the National Guard. While official data indicates a decline in violent crime, Trump's move follows an attack on a government staffer.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/liberation-day-why-is-trump-taking-over-washington-dc-all-you-need-to-know-about-crackdown-in-deep-blue-state/articleshow/123240129.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/liberation-day-why-is-trump-taking-over-washington-dc-all-you-need-to-know-about-crackdown-in-deep-blue-state/articleshow/123240129.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-11T21:34:09+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://stati